message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Q-CIS — Quantum Coordinate Intelligence System"
abstract: >-
  A classical, quantum-inspired learning architecture based on coordinate-based state
  evolution, complex-valued amplitudes and phases, and interference-based decisions.
  This is a partial public research release: documentation and author-reported findings only.
  No quantum advantage or physical quantum computation is claimed.
type: software
